meta {
  name: 2 over threshold succeeds
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Attendee orders one item within the baseline hold, then a larger order that
  exceeds it. The overage hold is created (402), confirmed on Stripe, and
  authorized via webhook. All items (first order + overage order) are then
  marked ready and fulfilled. Organizer checkout captures the authorized holds
  and the tab is PAID.

  NOTE: The overage order uses 6 items. For a 402 to be triggered the product
  must cost more than (1000 - firstItemPrice) / 6 cents (~167 cents / €1.67).
  Increase the item count in "06 submit order over limit.bru" for cheaper
  products and add matching ready/fulfill steps.
}
